---
description: Route uni-app work through the Koi Agent Skill source of truth
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md`, then inspect `.agent/skills/index.yaml`. Load the active spec
and only the matching `.agent/skills/<skill-id>/SKILL.md`; do not copy Skill
content into Cursor rules.

Stable is the default. Read `profiles/weixin-ai-alpha/` only when the spec
explicitly selects it. Finish implementation work with `npm run validate:fast`,
then `npm run build:h5`, then `npm run build:mp-weixin`.
